This dataset is the result of a one day study involving several phases: Habituation, Fear Conditioning Acquisition, Fear Extinction using mental imagery, Fear extinction recall using visual presentation.

Note, that participants in this study did complete a previous "Day 1" study involving fear conditioning with different stimuli. This study was conducted outside the MRI and is described in a separate publication: Jiang, X., & Greening, S. G. (2021). Psychophysiological evidence for fear extinction learning via mental imagery. Psychophysiology, 58(11), e13906. https://doi.org/10.1111/psyp.13906


